## phylogenetic_tree.txt
- Newick; root 'Spermatophyta'; internal clade names (Pentapetalae, Caryophyllales.rn.d8s.tre, mrca*).
- 81 species tips; exactly matches the 81 phylo.tip.label values in invasion_success_pathways.csv.
- 4 multi-pathway species have '2'-suffixed tips (Eucalyptus_camaldulensis2, Opuntia_ficus-indica2,
  Oxalis_debilis2, Populus_deltoides2) -> tree is at row level (81 tips), one-to-one with CSV rows.
- Only Iris_x_germanica deviates from genus_epithet naming (x retained).

