- 191/632 plots (30%) invaded; 481 occurrences (gard 169, unint 289, agfo 23).
- habitat (10): Scrublands 106, Croplands 92, Coniferous forests 77, Broad-leaved forests 68,
  Urban 65, Riparian 61, Rock outcrops 57, Meadows 39, Wetlands 38, Coastal 29.
